# Day 38/60 — AI Typing Speed Studio

## Objective

Today I built an AI Typing Speed Studio, an interactive application that helps users improve typing speed, accuracy, and consistency through multiple practice modes and detailed performance analytics.

The application provides real-time feedback and visual insights to make typing practice engaging and measurable.

---

## What Was Generated

- AI Typing Speed Studio
- Multiple Typing Modes
- Live WPM Counter
- Accuracy Tracking
- Performance Analytics Dashboard
- Session Statistics
- Responsive HTML Application

---

## What I Learned

### Measuring Performance Drives Improvement

Tracking speed and accuracy makes practice sessions more effective and helps identify areas for improvement.

### Real-Time Feedback Increases Engagement

Instant performance metrics motivate users to refine their typing skills continuously.

### Analytics Enhance Learning

Visualizing progress over time provides valuable insights into consistency and long-term improvement.

### AI Can Create Interactive Learning Tools

AI-assisted development simplifies building engaging educational applications with dynamic feedback.

